  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **It Must Have Been the Roses**: back after 54 archived shows (846 days); rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2021-10-11.PNCPavillionCharlotteNC** (recommended): audience recording; 17 songs; 182 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Lineup listed: Bob Weir on guitar and vocals, John Mayer on guitar and vocals, Oteil Burbridge on bass and vocals [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2021-10-11.PNCPavillionCharlotteNC**: taped by W. Zimmerman; transferred by JT/NY; source: Aud > Sennheiser Me-80 Mini Shotguns> GakCables > Mix Pre 6 @ 16/48 [1]. Also: Audience recording made with Sennheiser ME-80 mini shotgun microphones, run through GakCables into a Mix Pre 6 recorder; Recorded at 16-bit/48kHz to SD card, then tracked and edited in Sound Forge Pro 13, converted to FLAC with Traders Little Helper [1]",
